			"notes": "## General\n\n- ✅ Rework of ~~rocket~~ spaceship model, featuring a fully walkable interior, door closing/opening animations, interactable/swappable components such as the carpets and more!\n\n- ✅ Reworked spaceship progression system, now being built through a blueprint + puzzle\n\n- ✅ Reworked fuel tank system, now being fed directly into the spaceship using the left screen of the cockpit\n\n- ✅ Reworked astronomy notebook, previously Astronomy Research Table, now functioning as a full in-game guide of progression and features, unlocking more entries as you progress through the mod!\n\n\n- 🔧 enderblaze fuel recipe now uses coal instead of blaze powder to make it more accessible early game\n\n- 🔧 Improved several screens, GUIs translations, typos, UI, UX, etc\n\n- 🔧  Bunch of changes too tiny to list out\n\n- ❌ removed tanks as they are no longer used\n- ❌ removed refuel station as it's no longer used\n- ❌ removed rocket item as it's no longer used\n- ❌ removed astronomy research table as it's no longer used\n\n## Asha & Lunamar:\n\n- ✅ improved several textures (thank you @nikdo53)\n- ✅ Added more structures and puzzles to explore!\n\n## Fishing\n\n- ✅ New fishing system (no in-game guide yet!)\n\nCatch new fish using your new Starcatcher's Fishing Rod! There are several fishes to be caught restricted by different conditions! Collection to be added later with help tips on where each fish is caught.\n\n# Asha Fishes:\nBluetale\nRedtale\nRed Herring\nAvian\nTwilight Trout\nThundercharged Eel\nEel\nMeadow Perch\nSolar Carp\nVery Tiny Shark\nAzure Tuna\nScarlet Tuna\nSage Tuna\nKarpenjoe\nStormsail Ray\nSunfang Eel\n\n# Lunamar Fishes:\nBubblemouth\nGlimpuff\nCrimson Starfish\nVerdant Seahorse\nRadiant Seahorse\nOcto\nRed Reef Octo\nLumen Drifter"
		},
