			"notes": "# Release Alpha 0.2\n\n## General\n\n- ✅ Reworked rocket model, now featuring a semi-detailed cockpit, as well as interactive elements to open the menus. Still very much WIP\n- ✅ Added more entries to the Astronomy Research Table\n- 🔧 Reworked a bunch of translations and tooltips, specially in the telescope & rocket GUI\n- 🔧  Fixed/added out-of-water flapping to all fishes\n\n## Asha:\n\n- ✅ Added new combat puzzle type and several structures it can spawn on. It spawns Drowned until custom enemies are added.\n- 🔧 Adjusted spawning of flowers and starflies, added different tree types to the Plains biome\n\n## Lunamar: \n\n- ✅ Added Bubblemouth, a new fish that spawns everywhere in Lunamar. It has everything you'd expect from a new fish (drops, eating, cooking, bucket-able), including a custom fishing loot-table to replace vanilla's salmon/cod when fishing in Lunamar.\n- ✅ Added Glimpuff, a new fish that spawns everywhere in Lunamar, but more common in the Verdure biome. When touching a moonshade kelp fruit, it will eat it and glow with emissive textures and particles. Texture still WIP\n\n## Ember\n- ✅ AddedEmber, a new planet with nothing but an endless desert biome in it. Literally there's nothing else there. There's no point in visiting.\n\n\ncurseforge - <https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/laicaps>\nmodrinth - <https://modrinth.com/mod/laicaps>\ngithub - <https://github.com/wdiscute/laicaps-neoforge-1.21.1>"
		},
